hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"24230","Hasan narrated to us, Ibn Lahi'ah narrated to us, Habban ibn Wasi' narrated to us, from his father, from Sa'd ibn al-Mundhir al-Ansari, that he said: O Messenger of Allah, shall I recite the Qur'an in three days? He said: Yes. And he used to recite it until he died."
